# Square Item Adder

Android business utility for adding and managing Square catalog items through structured API workflows.

## Overview
Square Item Adder is a Kotlin-based utility project designed to explore product/catalog creation workflows using Square's sandbox API. It demonstrates API request handling, validation, structured item data, and business tooling concepts.

## Features
- Create or update Square catalog items
- Work with item options and variation data
- Handle API validation errors
- Support structured product-entry workflows
- Sandbox-focused development and testing

## Tech Stack
- Kotlin
- Android
- Ktor / OkHttp
- Square Sandbox API
- JSON
- REST APIs

## What This Demonstrates
- Business systems thinking
- API troubleshooting
- Catalog/product data modeling
- Error handling and debugging
- Mobile tooling for small-business workflows

## Status
Sandbox portfolio project.
